{"Categories":[8],"HiddenTopics":[24],"Topics":[3],"Id":97,"TextResource":{"Name":"pronto-copec","Translations":[{"Text":"Pronto Copec","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"Pronto Copec","Abbreviation":""}]},"ShapeIndexes":{"ActualShapeList":[{"FloorId":"3","Id":116}]},"Description":{"Name":"description","Translations":[{"Text":"<p>Pronto Copec, lo mejor de las carreteras de Chile ahora en el Aeropuerto. Especializado en sandwich, hamburguesas y el tradicional completo. No dejes de probar las ensaladas frescas y la variada oferta de bebidas, jugos, caf\u00e9 y tortas.<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""},{"Text":"<p>We offer the best hamburgers, sandwhiches and hot dogs. Are you on a diet ? Try our daily fresh salads, fruit juices, coffee and our variety of desserts.\u00a0On the go? We also do take out !\u00a0We are located at the round point on the 3rd floor. We are open 24\\\/7.\u00a0Come visit us!<\/p>\n","Abbreviation":""}]},"Created":"1488916788","Updated":"1489712624","Picture":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/097_pronto-copec.png"},"Url":{"Name":"Url","Translations":{"1":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/en\/viadirect\/361\/node\/368","Abbreviation":""},"0":{"Text":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/es\/viadirect\/361\/node\/368","Abbreviation":""}}},"LogoMap":{"Translations":{"1":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/097_pronto-copec.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/97\/MapLogo_1.png"},"0":{"Url":"http:\/\/front-airport-pudahuel.viadirect.com\/sites\/default\/files\/viadirect\/logos\/map\/0\/097_pronto-copec.png","LocalUrl":"Destinations\/97\/MapLogo_0.png"}}},"ExternalDatas":{"Data":[{"key":"field_opening_hours","label":"Opening hours","field_name":"field_restaurant_opening_hours"},{"key":"field_phone","label":"Phone","field_name":"field_restaurant_phone"},{"key":"field_website","label":"Website","field_name":"field_restaurant_website